  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">• Brand introduction: HEIPI 3 IN 1 Travel Tripod</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">• Product description:<span style=\"color: rgb(28, 29, 29); text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">The secret behind HEIPI’s stability and portability lies in its construction, especially its innovative pioneering&nbsp;</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(28, 29, 29); text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">“<strong>3-pillar</strong>” center column</span><span style=\"color: rgb(28, 29, 29); text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">. We spent 3 years designing and perfecting it. After multiple models, we finally got the ideal HEIPI — a portable, stable and versatile 3-in-1 travel tripod.</span>&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">• USP (Unique Selling Point): <span style=\"color: rgb(28, 29, 29); text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">In order to strike a great balance between portability and stability, we invented the “three-pillar” center column, which not only improves the stability, but also works as a desk tripod to fit the main tripod tightly, achieving unrivaled space efficiency.</span>&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;</p></div>",
